of being professional.

528
00:32:02.921 --> 00:32:04.173
DIANDRA:
You're right.

529
00:32:04.256 --> 00:32:08.969
Actually, I'm surprised
that you don't agree.

530
00:32:09.053 --> 00:32:10.262
When you were tenured,

531
00:32:10.346 --> 00:32:13.182
