and how many articles?

532
00:32:13.265 --> 00:32:16.018
- Too many.
- Right. A ton.

533
00:32:17.061 --> 00:32:19.063
We have all been through the process,

534
00:32:19.146 --> 00:32:23.567
and we know how grueling it is,
but we earned it.

535
00:32:23.651 --> 00:32:28.197
